# Pattern First

Every page layout MUST use a named pattern from `@charts-gen/ui` (e.g., `AppLayout`, `SplitLayout`). Pages are forbidden from defining their own layout grids or flex structures.

## Why
Standardizes the spatial grammar of the application and simplifies page composition.

## Examples
// ❌ BAD
export default function Page() {
  return (
    <div className="flex h-screen">
      <aside className="w-64">...</aside>
      <main className="flex-1">...</main>
    </div>
  );
}

// ✅ GOOD
export default function Page() {
  return (
    <AppLayout sidebar={<Sidebar />}>
      <MainContent />
    </AppLayout>
  );
}
